---
title: Factories, essence, and the End
pageSlug: factories
modpack: sc-final-adventure-machines
section: gameplay
order: 2
---

Hunt a boss. Farm what it dropped. Spend that in a line. Repeat until the End recipe makes sense.

**Hunt.** Cataclysm fights are resource nodes. Learn the arena. The drop is the point of the trip, not a trophy you put in an item frame and forget.

**Farm.** Easy Mob Farm and Create New Age turn those drops into a feed you do not have to babysit. Automate the boring part early. Hand-crafting essence in the late game is how people quit.

**Build.** Create and Mekanism do logistics and power. Pack recipes keep the line aimed at adventure, not infinite ore for its own sake.

**End.** Mechanical Crafting. Treat it like a capstone, not a side project you start after you are bored.

If a recipe is locked, the quest book is usually holding the item you have not fought yet. Go fight it. Then come back to the basin.
